Set up OpenMausBot (https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot) from source on this
work Mac for desktop use, with NO data leaving the organisation. Explain each step
before running it. Stop and ask me before anything marked [ASK].

HARD RULES
- No sudo, no system-wide installs, no changing macOS security settings (Gatekeeper,
  firewall, profiles, MDM). If a step seems to need one, stop and [ASK].
- Do NOT install Ollama or download any LLM model. Models come from our existing
  LiteLLM proxy (see step 7).
- Do NOT set up Composio, Cloudflare tunnel, Tailscale, Boat, OMB Cloud, hosted voice
  keys (ElevenLabs/Fish/xAI), or any image-generation provider.
- Never print, log, or commit secrets. I will type API keys myself; do not ask me to
  paste them into chat.
- Do not claim anything works without evidence (command output, logs). Read AGENTS.md
  and docs/verification/README.md in the repo before claiming a server change works.

1. PREREQUISITES
   - Check `node -v` (need Node 24+), `pnpm -v` (else `corepack enable`), `git --version`.
